| 2026-04-02   | Communicate with student union            | Catering Team            |
| 2026-04-03   | Transport bottled water to student union  | Logistics Team           |
| 2026-04-10   | Follow-up meeting with student union      | Catering Team            |

---

## Conclusion

The redistribution of surplus bottled water to the student union aligns with our commitment to sustainability and resource efficiency. By repurposing surplus resources for future events, we reduce waste and support campus-wide activities. The outlined plan ensures a smooth and collaborative process, benefiting both the catering team and the student union.

